== Notes Regarding Seed Effects ==
* While the BRTL B0NS seed is enabled, getting hit will not result in death if Isaac possesses {{e|Red Heart}}s as well as {{e|Soul Heart}}s or {{e|Black Heart}}s. Instead, the Soul hearts and/or Black hearts will be completely depleted, leaving Isaac with only his Red hearts. You can also prevent death with {{e|Bone Heart}}s, as they will get depleted without destroying the bone heart and protecting the rest of the hearts, and can be refilled with Red Hearts. The soul hearts in front of them will get destroyed though.
* If the ICES KATE seed is enabled, purple champion monsters are be much more dangerous, as escaping their gravitational pull becomes almost impossible.
* When playing with the KAPP A seed enabled, certain items will override the grayscale, such as {{i|Kidney Stone}}.
* When the seed PACI FISM is enabled, effects that kill enemies on impact such as {{I|Euthanasia}} and {{I|Little Horn}} still remove enemies, but they will respawn when the room is re-entered. No effect occurs after killing all in a room.
* Some seeds can not be enabled alongside other certain seeds. For example, the PTCH BLCK seed cannot be enabled alongside THEB LANK.
* It is possible to access other chapters while playing the BASE MENT seed. Stepping into the beam of light after using {{i|Genesis}} can take Isaac to chapter II, avoiding the standard loop after the first two basement floors. Additionally, {{R|Sacrifice Room}}s after 12 uses can be used at any point to teleport to the {{s|Dark Room}}, making it possible to see a proper ending and finish the run.

== Trivia ==
* Many of the special seeds can be found by using either the  {{M|Fortune Telling Machine}} or the {{P|Rules Card}}.
* Some special seeds were shared with the community by the developers.
* If an [[item]] that would appear on a seed is not unlocked yet, it will be replaced by another item that is unlocked.
* The "DYSL EXIA" seed is a reference to [[Wikipedia:Dyslexia|dyslexia]], a disorder that causes difficulties in spelling, reading, and writing.
* The seeds "ANDA NTE", "LARG HET0", "ALLE GR0", and "PRES T0" refer to ''andante'', ''larghetto'', ''allegro'', and ''presto'', respectively. These are names of musical [[wikipedia:Tempo|tempos]], which are the speeds of given pieces of music.
* The "KAPP A" seed is a reference to a commonly used Twitch emote "KAPPA".
* The "ALM1 GHTY" seed's description is, "Dog Mode". This is referencing the term "God mode", which is used to describe someone or something in a game that has invincibility, usually attained through the use of cheats.
** "Dog Mode" is also a reference to the 1994 first-person shooter game ''[[wikipedia:Rise of the Triad|Rise of the Triad]]'', which has a power-up of the same name.
* The "FEAR M1NT" seed is a reference to [[wikipedia:spearmint|spearmint]], an herb popularly used for flavoring food.
* Although the "T1NY D0ME" seed also makes Isaac's hitbox somewhat smaller and could be considered beneficial, it does not prevent achievements.
* {{dlc|r}} The "SVPE RH0T" seed is a [[References|reference]] to the 2016 first-person shooter game ''[[wikipedia:Superhot|Superhot]]''.
* {{dlc|r}} "M0DE SEVN" i.e. Mode 7 is a [[wikipedia:Mode 7|graphics mode]] on the Super Nintendo Entertainment System console that often results in pronounced pixelation.
* {{dlc|r}}"GFVE LLLL" is used as 11/4/2022 and 3/24/2023's daily runs.
* {{dlc|r}} While using {{c|Tainted Forgotten|n}} in the "SVPE RH0T" seed, time will only move when the skeleton moves.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=a|Entering the [[Blue Womb]] while using the "N0RE TVRN" seed is not recommended as the door leading to the Boss Room will not spawn, thereby trapping the player and ending the run.}}
{{bug|Returning to the menu from a run that uses a seed that alters audio speed will cause the main menu audio to remain altered. This resets upon entering a new run, or exiting the game.}}
{{bug|dlc=r|The PAC1F1SM seed does not allow you to finish a The Beast run. Dogma never transforms in his second phase. If you manage to go to the Beast fight (with the debug console), the Chest spawns before Ultra Famine is killed.}}

